<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>But He call’d me closer to Him,</l><l>Bade my doubting, fearing, cease;</l><l>And when I had fully yielded,</l><l>Filled my soul with perfect peace.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now I’m trusting every moment,</l><l>Nothing less can be enough;</l><l>And the Savior bears me gently</l><l>O’er those places once so rough.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Day by day my soul He’s keeping</l><l>By His wondrous power within;</l><l>And my heart is full of singing</l><l>To my Savior from all sin.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
